---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../../../components/Hero.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Terms of use of the Pétanque Scanner app | Ludiven Studio"
	description="General terms of use and sale of the Pétanque Scanner app: service, free scans, Lifetime Premium, liability."
	lang="en"
	alternates={{ fr: '/petanque-scanner/cgu/', en: '/en/petanque-scanner/cgu/', es: '/es/petanque-scanner/cgu/', de: '/de/petanque-scanner/cgu/', it: '/it/petanque-scanner/cgu/' }}
>
	<div class="wrapper stack gap-12 legal">
		<Hero
			title="Terms of use — Pétanque Scanner"
			tagline="General terms of use and sale of the mobile app."
		/>

		<p class="updated">
			<strong>Pétanque Scanner</strong> app (<code>com.raphbenpro.petanquear</code>) — last updated:
			10 September 2026.
		</p>
		<p class="updated">
			This is a courtesy translation. In case of discrepancy, the
			<a href="/petanque-scanner/cgu/" hreflang="fr">original French version</a> prevails.
		</p>

		<div class="summary">
			<p><strong>Key points before you play:</strong></p>
			<ul>
				<li>The measurements shown are <strong>for guidance only</strong>. They rely on augmented reality and do not replace a tape measure or an umpire's decision.</li>
				<li>3 free scans per day. Beyond that, watch an ad to get more, or buy Premium.</li>
				<li>Premium is a <strong>one-off purchase</strong>, with no subscription, tied to your App Store or Google Play account.</li>
			</ul>
		</div>

		<section class="stack gap-2">
			<h2>1. Purpose and acceptance</h2>
			<p>
				These general terms govern the use of the Pétanque Scanner mobile app (hereinafter "the App") and the sale
				of its paid option. By downloading, installing or using the App, you accept these terms without
				reservation. If you do not accept them, please do not use the App and uninstall it.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="stack gap-2">
			<h2>2. Publisher</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>Company name: <strong>Ludiven Studio</strong></li>
				<li>Legal form: EURL (French single-member limited company) with share capital of €1,000</li>
				<li>Registration: 999&nbsp;253&nbsp;586 R.C.S. Vienne — SIRET 999&nbsp;253&nbsp;586&nbsp;00013</li>
				<li>EU VAT number: FR20&nbsp;999253586</li>
				<li>Registered office: 1166 route de la Ranche, 38440 Châtonnay, France</li>
				<li>Publication director: Ludiven Studio</li>
				<li>Contact: <a href="mailto:contact@ludiven-studio.fr">contact@ludiven-studio.fr</a></li>
			</ul>
			<p>See also the <a href="/mentions-legales/">legal notice</a> (in French).</p>
		</section>

		<section class="stack gap-2">
			<h2>3. Description of the service</h2>
			<p>
				The App uses your phone's camera and augmented reality to detect the pétanque boules and the jack
				("cochonnet") on the pitch, then estimates the distances between them and shows them to you on the
				screen.
			</p>
			<p>
				If your phone does not support augmented reality, the App automatically switches to a
				<strong>photo mode</strong>: you frame the pitch and take a single shot, from which the ranking of the
				boules is estimated. This mode identifies the closest boule and shows an <strong>approximate
				distance</strong>, presented as such in the App. As it relies on a single image, it is by nature more
				sensitive to the shooting angle than the augmented reality mode: the accuracy warning below applies to it
				all the more. When the gap between the first two boules is too small to be decided reliably, the App tells
				you so and invites you to measure with a tape.
			</p>
			<p>
				<strong>Important accuracy warning.</strong> The distances shown are <strong>estimates</strong> produced by
				automatic image processing and by the phone's motion tracking. Their accuracy depends on many factors
				beyond the publisher's control: lighting, type and unevenness of the ground, reflections on the boules,
				occlusions, the quality of your device's sensors, the steadiness of your hand, the shooting distance.
				Consequently:
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>the App is a <strong>helpful, social tool</strong>, not a measuring instrument;</li>
				<li>it does <strong>not constitute umpiring</strong> and has no official value in a competition;</li>
				<li>in case of dispute, only a physical measurement and, where applicable, the umpire's decision are authoritative;</li>
				<li>the publisher cannot be held liable for the outcome of a game, a bet or a dispute based on a measurement shown by the App.</li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section class="stack gap-2">
			<h2>4. Access and technical requirements</h2>
			<p>
				Using the App requires a supported operating system version and permission to access the camera.
				<strong>Without camera access, the App cannot work.</strong> The main mode, in augmented reality, requires
				a smartphone compatible with ARCore (Android) or ARKit (iOS); on a non-compatible device, the App remains
				usable and automatically switches to the photo mode described in §3. An Internet connection is needed to
				display ads and to make a purchase, but the scan itself works offline.
			</p>
			<p>No account needs to be created. Connection and equipment costs are borne by you.</p>
		</section>

		<section class="stack gap-2">
			<h2>5. Free model and usage limits</h2>
			<p>
				The App is free to download and offers <strong>3 scans per day</strong> at no cost, accompanied by an
				advertising banner.
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>The counter resets every day, based on a reference time obtained online to ensure fairness between users.</li>
				<li>When the limit is reached, you can <strong>watch a video ad</strong> to get your 3 scans back, or buy Premium.</li>
				<li>The number of scans offered, the frequency of ads and the recharge conditions are parameters of the free service, which the publisher may change (see §12).</li>
				<li>Any attempt to bypass the limits (by changing the clock, the app or local storage) is prohibited and may cause malfunctions for which the publisher is not liable.</li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section class="stack gap-2">
			<h2>6. "Lifetime Premium" option</h2>
			<p>
				Premium is a <strong>one-off, permanent purchase</strong>, with no subscription or recurring payment. It
				gives you:
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>removal of all ads</strong>;</li>
				<li><strong>unlimited scans</strong>, with no daily limit.</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				<strong>Scope of the word "lifetime".</strong> This term means that the purchase is not limited in time and
				requires no renewal. However, it must be understood within the following limits, which you expressly
				accept:
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Premium is tied to the <strong>App Store or Google Play account</strong> that made the purchase, not to you as a person nor to a specific device; it is <strong>non-transferable</strong> to another account and may not be resold or assigned;</li>
				<li>it can be used on the devices linked to that account, within the limits set by the app store concerned;</li>
				<li>it covers the App as it exists and as it will evolve, but is not a guarantee that the App will remain available forever: the publisher may be forced to discontinue the service (see §12);</li>
				<li>it does not include any separate apps the publisher may release in the future.</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				<strong>Restoring.</strong> If you reinstall the App or change device, your purchase is normally
				reactivated automatically at launch. A "Restore my purchase" button is also available on the offer screen.
				If restoring fails, contact us.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="stack gap-2">
			<h2>7. Price and payment</h2>
			<p>
				The price of Premium is the one shown in the App at the time of purchase, in your currency, including
				taxes. It is set, and may be adjusted, by the publisher, in particular according to the app stores' price
				tiers; any change has no effect on purchases already made.
			</p>
			<p>
				<strong>Payment is made exclusively through Apple (App Store) or Google (Google Play)</strong>, depending
				on the platform you downloaded from, and is governed by their terms. The publisher has no access to any
				banking data. The invoice or proof of purchase is issued by the app store.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="stack gap-2">
			<h2>8. Right of withdrawal and refunds</h2>
			<p>
				Premium is digital content supplied immediately after purchase. In accordance with Article L221-28 13° of
				the French Consumer Code, by requesting immediate access to the content, you <strong>expressly waive your
				right of withdrawal</strong> of fourteen days, which you acknowledge at the time of purchase.
			</p>
			<p>
				Refund requests fall under the policy of the app store where the purchase was made:
				<a href="https://support.apple.com/en-gb/HT204084" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Apple</a> or
				<a href="https://support.google.com/googleplay/answer/2479637?hl=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Play</a>.
				We cannot technically refund a purchase on their behalf, but we can help you with the process: write to
				us. Your statutory guarantees of conformity and against hidden defects remain in force in all cases.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="stack gap-2">
			<h2>9. Advertising</h2>
			<p>
				The free App displays ads provided by Google AdMob. The choice of ads is made by this ad network; the
				publisher does not individually control their content and cannot be held liable for the products or
				services promoted in them. How your consent is managed and how your data is used for this purpose are
				described in our <a href="/en/petanque-scanner/confidentialite/">privacy policy</a>.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="stack gap-2">
			<h2>10. Your obligations</h2>
			<p>You agree to:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>use the App in compliance with the laws in force and the rights of third parties, in particular the image rights of people who may appear in the camera's field of view;</li>
				<li>not decompile, disassemble, modify or attempt to bypass the App's protections, except within the limits permitted by law;</li>
				<li>not disrupt the operation of the service or attempt to gain fraudulent access to paid features;</li>
				<li>stay aware of your surroundings while using it: the App requires you to handle a phone while looking at the screen, which reduces your alertness. Do not use it while walking on uneven ground, near a road, or while a boule is in play.</li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section class="stack gap-2">
			<h2>11. Intellectual property</h2>
			<p>
				The App, its code, interfaces, detection models, texts and graphic elements are the property of the
				publisher and are protected by intellectual property law. Buying Premium grants a <strong>personal,
				non-exclusive right of use</strong>, not a transfer of ownership. Third-party trademarks, logos and names
				mentioned remain the property of their respective owners. "Pétanque" is a generic term; the App is not
				affiliated with any federation or sports organisation.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="stack gap-2">
			<h2>12. Changes, interruption and discontinuation of the service</h2>
			<p>
				The publisher may change the App, add or remove features, and adjust the parameters of the free model. It
				may suspend the service temporarily for maintenance, or discontinue it permanently, in particular if its
				operation is no longer technically or economically viable, or if a platform requires its removal.
			</p>
			<p>
				In the event of permanent discontinuation, the publisher will endeavour to inform users through an update
				or the app's store listing, with reasonable notice. Features that do not require a connection will remain
				usable for as long as the installed version remains compatible with your operating system.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="stack gap-2">
			<h2>13. Liability</h2>
			<p>
				The App is provided as is. Beyond the warning in §3 on the accuracy of measurements, the publisher does
				not guarantee that the App will work without interruption or error on all devices, nor that it will be
				fit for a particular purpose.
			</p>
			<p>
				The publisher can only be held liable in the event of proven fault, and liability is limited to direct
				and foreseeable damage. It does not cover indirect damage (loss of data, loss of a stake or a bet, damage
				to reputation, dispute between players). Nothing in these terms excludes the publisher's liability in the
				event of fraud, gross negligence or physical injury, nor limits your mandatory consumer rights.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="stack gap-2">
			<h2>14. Personal data</h2>
			<p>
				The processing of your data is described in our
				<a href="/en/petanque-scanner/confidentialite/">privacy policy</a>, which forms an integral part of these
				terms. Key point: camera images are processed only on your device and are never transmitted.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="stack gap-2">
			<h2>15. Governing law and dispute resolution</h2>
			<p>
				These terms are governed by <strong>French law</strong>. If you are a consumer residing in another member
				state of the European Union, you keep the benefit of the mandatory protective provisions of your country
				of residence.
			</p>
			{/* TODO legal: keep in sync with the French page once the mediator is named (art. L612-1). */}
			<p>
				If a problem arises, please first send us a complaint by email: we undertake to seek an amicable
				solution. If it is not resolved within one month, you can refer the matter free of charge to a consumer
				mediator, in accordance with Article L612-1 of the French Consumer Code: the contact details of the
				mediator to which Ludiven Studio belongs are published on this page and provided on request at
				<a href="mailto:contact@ludiven-studio.fr">contact@ludiven-studio.fr</a>. You can also use the European
				online dispute resolution platform.
			</p>
			<p>Failing agreement, the dispute will be brought before the competent courts.</p>
		</section>

		<section class="stack gap-2">
			<h2>16. Contact</h2>
			<p>
				For any question about these terms or to report a problem:
				<a href="mailto:contact@ludiven-studio.fr">contact@ludiven-studio.fr</a>.
			</p>
		</section>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>

